MediaPipe Face Landmark model
=============================

face_landmark_detector.onnx and face_landmark_detector.data are the MediaPipe
Face Landmark Detector exported to ONNX (Apache-2.0), as distributed with the
Qualcomm AI Hub model assets and metadata.json included here.

The model is used by crates/algo/src/face_mesh.rs to predict 468 face landmarks
for Face Reshape. It is not modified. The original ONNX graph references its
weights through the external-data file named face_landmark_detector.data; that
exact filename is kept.

